    3. Benefits of Census Information 
     The Census was designed to count persons where they live in usual residence on 
    census day. The uses of census information were as follows. 
     3.1 Government   
    1) To determine adequate policies or plans related to population, economic, 
    social and environmental issues both at the country level and locality level. 
    2) To prepare the budget in order to pr ovide public utilities and services to 
